station-event-gravity-failure-start-announcement = Feedback surge detected in mass-distribution systems. Artificial gravity has been disabled whilst the system reinitializes. Please stand by.
station-event-gravity-failure-end-announcement = Gravity generators are again functioning within normal parameters. We apologize for the inconvenience.

station-event-cult-invasion-announcement = Attention, unknown humanoid and non-humanoid entities have been detected warping into the facility near {$location}! We advise crew to move to a secure area immediately.

cult-invasion-crumble = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} crumbles away.
cult-invasion-crumble-laugh = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} lets out a maddening laugh as its body crumbles away.
cult-invasion-crumble-scream = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} lets out a horrified scream as its body crumbles away.
cult-invasion-crumble-dust = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} lets out a shrill chirp as its body turns to dust.
cult-invasion-crumble-hiss = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} hisses as it collapses into a pile of bones.
cult-invasion-crumble-melt = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} melts into a pile of blood and bones.
cult-invasion-crumble-burn = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} burns away into nothing.
cult-invasion-crumble-shatter = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} shatters into bone and blood, like the mirror in its hand.
cult-invasion-crumble-dark-laugh = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} lets out a dark laugh as it collapses into a puddle of blood.
cult-invasion-crumble-construct = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} falls apart into a heap of runed metal.
cult-invasion-crumble-shade = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} dissipates with a wail.
cult-invasion-crumble-gibber = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} gibbers one last time and goes still.
